			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Enforce explicit Fn path for UriFromFilePath\n\nUpdate the import in `FileRealpath.rs` to use the fully qualified path `UriComponents::FromFilePath::Fn` instead of the module alias `UriFromFilePath`. This change aligns the file handler with the project's strict `Struct::Struct` and `Fn` naming conventions, ensuring all function calls are explicit and removing implicit module re-exports.\n\nThis maintains consistency with recent refactoring efforts that migrate inline types and functions to dedicated PascalCase modules, reducing ambiguity in the IPC service layer.",
			"SHA": "131a323c4b30b6ec65ba209721d9e3ffd554fd24"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-02T09:04:49Z",
